| riscos-mesa test, linked "mixed" with the GPU library: gpushare, shared GLES 2 contexts current in two threads at once (as a threaded compositor would). Saves gpushare.
| With !RISC3D in !Boot.Resources on a Pi 4 (V3DRender) it draws on the GPU;
| elsewhere in software: RISC3D decides, not the program.
| UnixLib is linked into the program; OpenGL, EGL, SDL and OpenAL come from
| !MesaLibs (this directory's copy, if none is booted) through !SharedLibs.
Set MesaMixed$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This test needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then IfThere Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot Then Run Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Error This test needs !SharedLibs (with ld-riscos/so/2) in !Boot.Resources
| (booting !MesaLibs copies the so/2 loader into !SharedLibs if it is missing)
If "<MesaLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Run <MesaMixed$Dir>.!MesaLibs.!Boot
Unset MesaMixed$SO2
IfThere SharedLibs:lib.ld-riscos-eabihf/so Then Set MesaMixed$SO2 1
If "<MesaMixed$SO2>" = "" Then Error The !SharedLibs booted has no ld-riscos/so/2, and !MesaLibs could not add it
| SOManager finds the program's libraries through <program>$LD$Env
Set gpu-share$LD$Env "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/MesaLibs:"
Dir <MesaMixed$Dir>
| two threads: PThreadTicker keeps them switching safely (UnixLib 5.0.1+)
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad PThrTicker
| ELF programs need the slot set before they start: the loader maps them into it
WimpSlot -min 16000K -max 16000K
Run gpu-share -o gpushare
